   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Kalpita-kāryakāraṇabhāva.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Kalpita-kāryakāraṇabhāva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b93",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Constructed or conventionally established causation.",
   "directed": "Constructed or conventionally established causation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b94",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, this isn’t quite the same as saying:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Now, this isn’t quite the same as saying:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b95",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“One is real and the other is just fake.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “One is real and the other is just fake.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b96",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because the conventional sequence is itself manifested through divine freedom.",
   "directed": "Because the conventional sequence is itself manifested through divine freedom."
  },
  {
   "id": "b97",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But there is a fundamental distinction.",
   "directed": "But there is a fundamental distinction."
  },
  {
   "id": "b98",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Let’s begin with ultimate causation.",
   "directed": "Let’s begin with ultimate causation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b99",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And here’s the extraordinary teaching.",
   "directed": "And here’s the extraordinary teaching."
  },
  {
   "id": "b100",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The supreme Lord manifests himself as the entire hierarchy of reality.",
   "directed": "The supreme Lord manifests himself as the entire hierarchy of reality."
  },
  {
   "id": "b101",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "From Śiva-tattva right down to earth.",
   "directed": "From Śiva-tattva right down to earth."
  },
  {
   "id": "b102",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Śivādi-dharānta.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Śivādi-dharānta."
  },
  {
   "id": "b103",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Everything.",
   "directed": "Everything."
  },
  {
   "id": "b104",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And these manifested forms are both distinct in appearance from his essential nature and resting within that very nature.",
   "directed": "And these manifested forms are both distinct in appearance from his essential nature and resting within that very nature."
  },
  {
   "id": "b105",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now listen carefully.",
   "directed": "Now listen carefully."
  },
  {
   "id": "b106",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Śiva doesn’t take some foreign material and start assembling the universe.",
   "directed": "Śiva doesn’t take some foreign material and start assembling the universe."
  },
  {
   "id": "b107",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "There’s no foreign material.",
   "directed": "There’s no foreign material."
  },
  {
   "id": "b108",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Nothing independently existing outside him.",
   "directed": "Nothing independently existing outside him."
  },
  {
   "id": "b109",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "He manifests himself through his own freedom.",
   "directed": "He manifests himself through his own freedom."
  },
  {
   "id": "b110",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Svātantrya.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Svātantrya."
  },
  {
   "id": "b111",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And because he’s inherently the agent, kartṛ, this manifestation is his own activity.",
   "directed": "And because he’s inherently the agent, kartṛ, this manifestation is his own activity."
  },
  {
   "id": "b112",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So the ultimate causal relationship is this:",
   "directed": "[short pause] So the ultimate causal relationship is this:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b113",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Free consciousness manifests itself as everything, while everything remains grounded in free consciousness.",
   "directed": "Free consciousness manifests itself as everything, while everything remains grounded in free consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b114",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "That’s the real causal foundation.",
   "directed": "That’s the real causal foundation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b115",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now.",
   "directed": "[short pause] Now."
  },
  {
   "id": "b116",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "What about ordinary causation?",
   "directed": "What about ordinary causation?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b117",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The seed and the sprout?",
   "directed": "The seed and the sprout?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b118",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The fire and the smoke?",
   "directed": "The fire and the smoke?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b119",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The potter and the pot?",
   "directed": "The potter and the pot?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b120",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Ah.",
   "directed": "Ah."
  },
  {
   "id": "b121",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "That brings us to a rather interesting argument.",
   "directed": "That brings us to a rather interesting argument."
  },
  {
   "id": "b122",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "3. A seed doesn’t necessarily need to make a sprout\nRight.",
   "directed": "3. A seed doesn’t necessarily need to make a sprout\nRight."
  },
  {
   "id": "b123",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Suppose I plant a seed.",
   "directed": "Suppose I plant a seed."
  },
  {
   "id": "b124",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A sprout appears.",
   "directed": "A sprout appears."
  },
  {
   "id": "b125",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You say:",
   "directed": "[short pause] You say:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b126",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“The seed caused the sprout.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “The seed caused the sprout.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b127",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Very good.",
   "directed": "Very good."
  },
  {
   "id": "b128",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But what exactly establishes that particular causal relationship?",
   "directed": "But what exactly establishes that particular causal relationship?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b129",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Why must a sprout follow a seed?",
   "directed": "Why must a sprout follow a seed?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b130",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Why must this cause precede that effect?",
   "directed": "Why must this cause precede that effect?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b131",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Abhinavagupta says the fixed ordering of cause and effect is manifested through:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Abhinavagupta says the fixed ordering of cause and effect is manifested through:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b132",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Niyati.",
   "directed": "Niyati."
  },
  {
   "id": "b133",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The power of determination.",
   "directed": "The power of determination."
  },
  {
   "id": "b134",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And niyati itself operates through the will of the supreme Lord.",
   "directed": "And niyati itself operates through the will of the supreme Lord."
  },
  {
   "id": "b135",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Parameśecchā.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Parameśecchā."
  },
  {
   "id": "b136",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So the regularities of conventional causation are not independent laws standing above Śiva.",
   "directed": "So the regularities of conventional causation are not independent laws standing above Śiva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b137",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "They’re expressions of his freedom.",
   "directed": "They’re expressions of his freedom."
  },
  {
   "id": "b138",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, he gives a rather provocative example.",
   "directed": "Now, he gives a rather provocative example."
  },
  {
   "id": "b139",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A sprout might arise through the will of a yogin.",
   "directed": "A sprout might arise through the will of a yogin."
  },
  {
   "id": "b140",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Yogīcchā.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Yogīcchā."
  },
  {
   "id": "b141",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And in ordinary experience a sprout arises from a seed.",
   "directed": "And in ordinary experience a sprout arises from a seed."
  },
  {
   "id": "b142",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But in dreams, other arrangements of things can appear.",
   "directed": "But in dreams, other arrangements of things can appear."
  },
  {
   "id": "b143",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A pot, for example, might appear without the ordinary waking sequence of clay, wheel and potter.",
   "directed": "A pot, for example, might appear without the ordinary waking sequence of clay, wheel and potter."
  },
  {
   "id": "b144",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, Abhinavagupta isn’t claiming that ordinary plants routinely sprout without seeds.",
   "directed": "Now, Abhinavagupta isn’t claiming that ordinary plants routinely sprout without seeds."
  },
  {
   "id": "b145",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "He’s challenging the idea that one particular causal sequence is metaphysically necessary in every conceivable manifestation.",
   "directed": "He’s challenging the idea that one particular causal sequence is metaphysically necessary in every conceivable manifestation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b146",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Within the ordinary world, the sequence is established.",
   "directed": "Within the ordinary world, the sequence is established."
  },
  {
   "id": "b147",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But that sequence itself depends upon divine freedom.",
   "directed": "But that sequence itself depends upon divine freedom."
  },
  {
   "id": "b148",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And the ultimate causal foundation remains the same, whether the appearance follows an ordinary sequence or an extraordinary one.",
   "directed": "And the ultimate causal foundation remains the same, whether the appearance follows an ordinary sequence or an extraordinary one."
  },
  {
   "id": "b149",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Śiva’s creative agency doesn’t disappear just because a particular event has an apparent intermediate cause.",
   "directed": "Śiva’s creative agency doesn’t disappear just because a particular event has an apparent intermediate cause."
  },
  {
   "id": "b150",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, let’s take an even more familiar example.",
   "directed": "Now, let’s take an even more familiar example."
  },
  {
   "id": "b151",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A pot.",
   "directed": "A pot."
  },
  {
   "id": "b152",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And its potter.",
   "directed": "And its potter."
  },
  {
   "id": "b153",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "4. The potter thinks he’s the one making the pot\nImagine a potter.",
   "directed": "4. The potter thinks he’s the one making the pot\nImagine a potter."
  },
  {
   "id": "b154",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Lovely fellow.",
   "directed": "Lovely fellow."
  },
  {
   "id": "b155",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "He’s got his clay.",
   "directed": "He’s got his clay."
  },
  {
   "id": "b156",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "His wheel.",
   "directed": "His wheel."
  },
  {
   "id": "b157",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "His tools.",
   "directed": "His tools."
  },
  {
   "id": "b158",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "His little workshop.",
   "directed": "His little workshop."
  },
  {
   "id": "b159",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And he’s making a pot.",
   "directed": "And he’s making a pot."
  },
  {
   "id": "b160",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Very impressive.",
   "directed": "Very impressive."
  },
  {
   "id": "b161",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You ask:",
   "directed": "[short pause] You ask:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b162",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "man",
   "text": "“Who made this?”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “Who made this?”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b163",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And he says:",
   "directed": "[short pause] And he says:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b164",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I did.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I did.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b165",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Fair enough.",
   "directed": "Fair enough."
  },
  {
   "id": "b166",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But Abhinavagupta has a question.",
   "directed": "But Abhinavagupta has a question."
  },
  {
   "id": "b167",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "What exactly does the potter contribute that is independent of the whole universe?",
   "directed": "What exactly does the potter contribute that is independent of the whole universe?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b168",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "His body?",
   "directed": "His body?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b169",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "That’s part of the universe.",
   "directed": "That’s part of the universe."
  },
  {
   "id": "b170",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "His hands?",
   "directed": "His hands?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b171",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Part of the universe.",
   "directed": "Part of the universe."
  },
  {
   "id": "b172",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The clay?",
   "directed": "The clay?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b173",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Part of the universe.",
   "directed": "Part of the universe."
  },
  {
   "id": "b174",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The wheel?",
   "directed": "The wheel?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b175",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Also part of the universe.",
   "directed": "Also part of the universe."
  },
  {
   "id": "b176",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "His knowledge of pottery?",
   "directed": "His knowledge of pottery?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b177",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "That’s an expression of consciousness.",
   "directed": "That’s an expression of consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b178",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "His intentions?",
   "directed": "His intentions?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b179",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Also consciousness.",
   "directed": "Also consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b180",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Even the circumstances that brought him into the workshop are part of the larger arrangement.",
   "directed": "Even the circumstances that brought him into the workshop are part of the larger arrangement."
  },
  {
   "id": "b181",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So where exactly are we going to locate this completely independent potter?",
   "directed": "So where exactly are we going to locate this completely independent potter?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b182",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Nowhere.",
   "directed": "Nowhere."
  },
  {
   "id": "b183",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And what’s especially funny is that the potter’s conviction:",
   "directed": "[short pause] And what’s especially funny is that the potter’s conviction:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b184",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I am the maker of this pot”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I am the maker of this pot”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b185",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "is itself something manifested through the supreme Lord.",
   "directed": "is itself something manifested through the supreme Lord."
  },
  {
   "id": "b186",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The potter’s agency is real within the conventional arrangement.",
   "directed": "The potter’s agency is real within the conventional arrangement."
  },
  {
   "id": "b187",
