  },
  {
   "id": "b378",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Mala here is the concealment of fullness.",
   "directed": "Mala here is the concealment of fullness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b379",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The condition in which consciousness appears diminished.",
   "directed": "The condition in which consciousness appears diminished."
  },
  {
   "id": "b380",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, distinguish this from:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Now, distinguish this from:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b381",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Rāga-tattva.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Rāga-tattva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b382",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "meta",
   "voice": "none",
   "text": "Attachment.",
   "directed": "Attachment."
  },
  {
   "id": "b383",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Rāga is already a more particular form of desire, conditioned by activity.",
   "directed": "Rāga is already a more particular form of desire, conditioned by activity."
  },
  {
   "id": "b384",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You aren’t merely experiencing some vague sense of incompleteness.",
   "directed": "You aren’t merely experiencing some vague sense of incompleteness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b385",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You’re now wanting something.",
   "directed": "You’re now wanting something."
  },
  {
   "id": "b386",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I want that.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I want that.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b387",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I want to do this.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I want to do this.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b388",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I need to experience that.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I need to experience that.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b389",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The vague sense of deficiency has become directed toward particular possibilities.",
   "directed": "The vague sense of deficiency has become directed toward particular possibilities."
  },
  {
   "id": "b390",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And karma — activity — is another matter again.",
   "directed": "And karma — activity — is another matter again."
  },
  {
   "id": "b391",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’ll explain the relationships properly when we reach the lower tattvas.",
   "directed": "We’ll explain the relationships properly when we reach the lower tattvas."
  },
  {
   "id": "b392",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But here’s the extraordinary claim.",
   "directed": "But here’s the extraordinary claim."
  },
  {
   "id": "b393",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Mala is not some foreign substance that has invaded Śiva.",
   "directed": "Mala is not some foreign substance that has invaded Śiva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b394",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "It arises through the supreme Lord’s own will to conceal his nature.",
   "directed": "It arises through the supreme Lord’s own will to conceal his nature."
  },
  {
   "id": "b395",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Svātma-pracchādana-icchā.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Svātma-pracchādana-icchā."
  },
  {
   "id": "b396",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The desire to conceal himself.",
   "directed": "The desire to conceal himself."
  },
  {
   "id": "b397",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, that’s going to upset anyone who imagines bondage must have been inflicted upon consciousness by something outside it.",
   "directed": "Now, that’s going to upset anyone who imagines bondage must have been inflicted upon consciousness by something outside it."
  },
  {
   "id": "b398",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "There’s nothing outside Śiva capable of imprisoning him.",
   "directed": "There’s nothing outside Śiva capable of imprisoning him."
  },
  {
   "id": "b399",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The contraction itself belongs to his freedom.",
   "directed": "The contraction itself belongs to his freedom."
  },
  {
   "id": "b400",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But we need to distinguish the conditions of different limited beings.",
   "directed": "But we need to distinguish the conditions of different limited beings."
  },
  {
   "id": "b401",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "7. Some souls are nearly free; others are still absolutely tangled\nNow Abhinavagupta introduces two classes of limited subject.",
   "directed": "7. Some souls are nearly free; others are still absolutely tangled\nNow Abhinavagupta introduces two classes of limited subject."
  },
  {
   "id": "b402",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "First:",
   "directed": "[short pause] First:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b403",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Vijñānākala.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Vijñānākala."
  },
  {
   "id": "b404",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A being whose condition of impurity is moving toward dissolution.",
   "directed": "A being whose condition of impurity is moving toward dissolution."
  },
  {
   "id": "b405",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The fundamental limitation hasn’t necessarily been completely removed.",
   "directed": "The fundamental limitation hasn’t necessarily been completely removed."
  },
  {
   "id": "b406",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But it is no longer nourishing fresh karmic involvement in the same way.",
   "directed": "But it is no longer nourishing fresh karmic involvement in the same way."
  },
  {
   "id": "b407",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Then:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b408",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Pralayākala.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Pralayākala."
  },
  {
   "id": "b409",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A being in a condition associated with cosmic dissolution.",
   "directed": "A being in a condition associated with cosmic dissolution."
  },
  {
   "id": "b410",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Here mala remains active or capable of further expansion.",
   "directed": "Here mala remains active or capable of further expansion."
  },
  {
   "id": "b411",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And when strengthened by it, karma becomes a cause of the extraordinary diversity of saṃsāric experiences.",
   "directed": "And when strengthened by it, karma becomes a cause of the extraordinary diversity of saṃsāric experiences."
  },
  {
   "id": "b412",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Pleasure.",
   "directed": "Pleasure."
  },
  {
   "id": "b413",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Pain.",
   "directed": "Pain."
  },
  {
   "id": "b414",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Different births.",
   "directed": "Different births."
  },
  {
   "id": "b415",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Different circumstances.",
   "directed": "Different circumstances."
  },
  {
   "id": "b416",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "All the varied conditions of limited existence.",
   "directed": "All the varied conditions of limited existence."
  },
  {
   "id": "b417",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, because these beings retain tendencies toward experience, the divine creator manifests the appropriate world.",
   "directed": "Now, because these beings retain tendencies toward experience, the divine creator manifests the appropriate world."
  },
  {
   "id": "b418",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The world is the field in which their dispositions and karmic conditions can unfold.",
   "directed": "The world is the field in which their dispositions and karmic conditions can unfold."
  },
  {
   "id": "b419",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But there’s another important point.",
   "directed": "But there’s another important point."
  },
  {
   "id": "b420",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Mala itself doesn’t suddenly wake up and start manufacturing karma.",
   "directed": "Mala itself doesn’t suddenly wake up and start manufacturing karma."
  },
  {
   "id": "b421",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "It’s inert.",
   "directed": "It’s inert."
  },
  {
   "id": "b422",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Jaḍa.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Jaḍa."
  },
  {
   "id": "b423",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "It has no independent power of action.",
   "directed": "It has no independent power of action."
  },
  {
   "id": "b424",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So what activates this entire process?",
   "directed": "So what activates this entire process?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b425",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Īśvarecchā.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Īśvarecchā."
  },
  {
   "id": "b426",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The will of the Lord.",
   "directed": "The will of the Lord."
  },
  {
   "id": "b427",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Again.",
   "directed": "Again."
  },
  {
   "id": "b428",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Abhinavagupta keeps bringing us back to the same principle.",
   "directed": "Abhinavagupta keeps bringing us back to the same principle."
  },
  {
   "id": "b429",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "No matter how complicated the cosmic machinery becomes, the ultimate power of manifestation belongs to supreme consciousness.",
   "directed": "No matter how complicated the cosmic machinery becomes, the ultimate power of manifestation belongs to supreme consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b430",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And now we’re going to define the aṇu itself.",
   "directed": "And now we’re going to define the aṇu itself."
  },
  {
   "id": "b431",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "8. The individual has a rather peculiar double nature\nWhat exactly is an individual soul?",
   "directed": "8. The individual has a rather peculiar double nature\nWhat exactly is an individual soul?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b432",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "An aṇu?",
   "directed": "An aṇu?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b433",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Abhinavagupta says it appears in two aspects.",
   "directed": "Abhinavagupta says it appears in two aspects."
  },
  {
   "id": "b434",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Cit.",
   "directed": "Cit."
  },
  {
   "id": "b435",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Conscious.",
   "directed": "Conscious."
  },
  {
   "id": "b436",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And:",
   "directed": "[short pause] And:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b437",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Acit.",
   "directed": "Acit."
  },
  {
   "id": "b438",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Nonconscious.",
   "directed": "Nonconscious."
  },
  {
   "id": "b439",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now this is a fascinating distinction.",
   "directed": "Now this is a fascinating distinction."
  },
  {
   "id": "b440",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The conscious aspect is:",
   "directed": "[short pause] The conscious aspect is:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b441",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Aiśvarya.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Aiśvarya."
  },
  {
   "id": "b442",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Lordship.",
   "directed": "Lordship."
  },
  {
   "id": "b443",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The divine nature.",
   "directed": "The divine nature."
  },
  {
   "id": "b444",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The power belonging to consciousness itself.",
   "directed": "The power belonging to consciousness itself."
  },
  {
   "id": "b445",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And the nonconscious aspect?",
   "directed": "And the nonconscious aspect?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b446",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "That is associated with mala.",
   "directed": "That is associated with mala."
  },
  {
   "id": "b447",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Limitation.",
   "directed": "Limitation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b448",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So the individual isn’t some entirely different substance from Śiva.",
   "directed": "So the individual isn’t some entirely different substance from Śiva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b449",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Its conscious reality is divine.",
   "directed": "Its conscious reality is divine."
  },
  {
   "id": "b450",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But it appears accompanied by a condition of insentience or limitation.",
   "directed": "But it appears accompanied by a condition of insentience or limitation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b451",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And because Śiva freely manifests such a condition, there arises a principle capable of serving as the material basis of further differentiated manifestations.",
   "directed": "And because Śiva freely manifests such a condition, there arises a principle capable of serving as the material basis of further differentiated manifestations."
  },
  {
   "id": "b452",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And that principle is:",
   "directed": "[short pause] And that principle is:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b453",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Māyā-tattva.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Māyā-tattva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b454",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, be very careful.",
   "directed": "Now, be very careful."
  },
  {
   "id": "b455",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because Abhinavagupta is about to distinguish two things that have the same name.",
   "directed": "Because Abhinavagupta is about to distinguish two things that have the same name."
  },
  {
   "id": "b456",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "First, there’s Māyā as a tattva.",
   "directed": "First, there’s Māyā as a tattva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b457",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "An insentient, pervasive causal principle.",
   "directed": "An insentient, pervasive causal principle."
  },
  {
   "id": "b458",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The material basis, upādāna-kāraṇa, of the lower manifestation.",
   "directed": "The material basis, upādāna-kāraṇa, of the lower manifestation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b459",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And then there’s Māyā as Śiva’s power.",
   "directed": "And then there’s Māyā as Śiva’s power."
  },
  {
   "id": "b460",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The divine Śakti that manifests this tattva.",
   "directed": "The divine Śakti that manifests this tattva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b461",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Those are not identical in function.",
   "directed": "Those are not identical in function."
  },
  {
   "id": "b462",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The first is an insentient principle within manifestation.",
   "directed": "The first is an insentient principle within manifestation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b463",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The second is the conscious divine power through which that principle appears.",
   "directed": "The second is the conscious divine power through which that principle appears."
  },
  {
   "id": "b464",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Do you see why that matters?",
   "directed": "Do you see why that matters?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b465",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because otherwise you’d hear that Māyā is inert and immediately conclude that Śiva’s power is somehow unconscious.",
   "directed": "Because otherwise you’d hear that Māyā is inert and immediately conclude that Śiva’s power is somehow unconscious."
  },
  {
   "id": "b466",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Absolutely not.",
   "directed": "[short pause] Absolutely not."
  },
  {
   "id": "b467",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Māyā-tattva is a manifestation of the conscious power, not the ultimate nature of that power.",
   "directed": "Māyā-tattva is a manifestation of the conscious power, not the ultimate nature of that power."
  },
  {
   "id": "b468",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And Abhinavagupta says a similar twofold understanding should be applied throughout the lower tattvas, from kalā down to earth.",
   "directed": "And Abhinavagupta says a similar twofold understanding should be applied throughout the lower tattvas, from kalā down to earth."
  },
  {
   "id": "b469",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Each has its particular manifested character, while its reality is grounded in Śiva’s creative power.",
   "directed": "Each has its particular manifested character, while its reality is grounded in Śiva’s creative power."
  },
  {
   "id": "b470",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, at this point he invokes the teaching of his own gurus.",
   "directed": "Now, at this point he invokes the teaching of his own gurus."
  },
  {
   "id": "b471",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And it’s rather provocative.",
   "directed": "And it’s rather provocative."
  },
  {
   "id": "b472",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "9. Even things imagined in consciousness have a mode of manifestation\nHis teachers give an argument concerning things that appear in conceptual imagination.",
   "directed": "9. Even things imagined in consciousness have a mode of manifestation\nHis teachers give an argument concerning things that appear in conceptual imagination."
  },
  {
   "id": "b473",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Saṃkalpa.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Saṃkalpa."
  },
  {
   "id": "b474",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Take a pot.",
   "directed": "Take a pot."
  },
  {
   "id": "b475",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You can imagine a pot.",
   "directed": "You can imagine a pot."
  },
  {
   "id": "b476",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And a pot can also appear in an externally differentiated, perceptible form.",
   "directed": "And a pot can also appear in an externally differentiated, perceptible form."
  },
  {
   "id": "b477",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The teachers extend this reasoning to subtle principles such as Māyā, kalā, prakṛti and buddhi.",
   "directed": "The teachers extend this reasoning to subtle principles such as Māyā, kalā, prakṛti and buddhi."
  },
  {
   "id": "b478",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Even to the classical example of an impossible thing:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Even to the classical example of an impossible thing:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b479",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A sky-flower.",
   "directed": "A sky-flower."
  },
  {
   "id": "b480",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Kha-puṣpa.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Kha-puṣpa."
  },
  {
   "id": "b481",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, this isn’t a sensible excuse to claim that every imaginary object can be found physically sitting in the garden.",
   "directed": "Now, this isn’t a sensible excuse to claim that every imaginary object can be found physically sitting in the garden."
  },
  {
   "id": "b482",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The argument concerns different modes of appearance and the relation between what is contemplated and what can be manifested.",
   "directed": "The argument concerns different modes of appearance and the relation between what is contemplated and what can be manifested."
  },
  {
   "id": "b483",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And here’s the practical implication.",
   "directed": "And here’s the practical implication."
  },
  {
   "id": "b484",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A yogin who attains direct awareness of these subtle principles may be considered accomplished.",
   "directed": "A yogin who attains direct awareness of these subtle principles may be considered accomplished."
  },
  {
   "id": "b485",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Siddha.",
   "directed": "Siddha."
  },
  {
   "id": "b486",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Even if their object is Māyā, kalā, prakṛti or buddhi rather than a gross physical thing.",
   "directed": "Even if their object is Māyā, kalā, prakṛti or buddhi rather than a gross physical thing."
  },
  {
   "id": "b487",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because direct contemplative access to these principles has significance within this cosmology.",
   "directed": "Because direct contemplative access to these principles has significance within this cosmology."
  },
  {
   "id": "b488",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Right.",
   "directed": "[short pause] Right."
  },
  {
   "id": "b489",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now we’ve established the material basis of manifestation.",
   "directed": "Now we’ve established the material basis of manifestation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b490",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Māyā.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Māyā."
  },
  {
   "id": "b491",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And from Māyā, the world unfolds.",
   "directed": "And from Māyā, the world unfolds."
  },
  {
   "id": "b492",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Viśvaprasava.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Viśvaprasava."
  },
  {
   "id": "b493",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The birth of the universe.",
   "directed": "The birth of the universe."
  },
  {
   "id": "b494",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But before we go any further, there’s another question.",
   "directed": "But before we go any further, there’s another question."
  },
  {
   "id": "b495",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Does all of this happen in an actual chronological sequence?",
   "directed": "Does all of this happen in an actual chronological sequence?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b496",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "10. Does Śiva create everything one thing at a time?\nRight.",
   "directed": "10. Does Śiva create everything one thing at a time?\nRight."
  },
  {
   "id": "b497",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Here’s the difficulty.",
   "directed": "Here’s the difficulty."
  },
  {
   "id": "b498",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’re about to say:",
   "directed": "[short pause] We’re about to say:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b499",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Māyā produces kalā.",
   "directed": "Māyā produces kalā."
  },
  {
   "id": "b500",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Kalā produces limited knowledge.",
   "directed": "Kalā produces limited knowledge."
  },
  {
   "id": "b501",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then attachment.",
   "directed": "Then attachment."
  },
  {
   "id": "b502",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Time.",
   "directed": "[short pause] Time."
  },
  {
   "id": "b503",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Determination.",
   "directed": "Determination."
  },
  {
   "id": "b504",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And so forth.",
   "directed": "And so forth."
  },
  {
   "id": "b505",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But didn’t we establish earlier that supreme consciousness isn’t constrained by time?",
   "directed": "But didn’t we establish earlier that supreme consciousness isn’t constrained by time?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b506",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "How can the ultimate creative act require one thing to exist before another?",
   "directed": "How can the ultimate creative act require one thing to exist before another?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b507",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Excellent.",
   "directed": "[short pause] Excellent."
  },
  {
   "id": "b508",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now you’re paying attention.",
   "directed": "Now you’re paying attention."
  },
  {
   "id": "b509",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Abhinavagupta says that in its ultimate nature, creation is:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Abhinavagupta says that in its ultimate nature, creation is:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b510",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Akrama.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Akrama."
  },
  {
   "id": "b511",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Nonsequential.",
   "directed": "Nonsequential."
  },
  {
   "id": "b512",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But it can nevertheless appear as:",
   "directed": "[short pause] But it can nevertheless appear as:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b513",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Krama.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Krama."
  },
  {
   "id": "b514",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Sequential.",
   "directed": "Sequential."
  },
  {
   "id": "b515",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And that’s the important distinction.",
   "directed": "And that’s the important distinction."
  },
  {
   "id": "b516",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The hierarchy is an intelligible ordering of manifestation.",
   "directed": "The hierarchy is an intelligible ordering of manifestation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b517",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "It doesn’t mean Śiva has to wait for one cosmic factory to finish manufacturing a tattva before he can start the next production line.",
   "directed": "It doesn’t mean Śiva has to wait for one cosmic factory to finish manufacturing a tattva before he can start the next production line."
  },
  {
   "id": "b518",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Moreover, different individuals possess different limiting conditions.",
   "directed": "Moreover, different individuals possess different limiting conditions."
  },
  {
   "id": "b519",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The collection of principles beginning with kalā can differ from one individual to another.",
   "directed": "The collection of principles beginning with kalā can differ from one individual to another."
  },
  {
   "id": "b520",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Yet through divine will, these powers may also be brought into a shared arrangement.",
   "directed": "Yet through divine will, these powers may also be brought into a shared arrangement."
  },
  {
   "id": "b521",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Like people participating in one gathering.",
   "directed": "Like people participating in one gathering."
  },
  {
   "id": "b522",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Different individual experiences, but a common manifested circumstance.",
   "directed": "Different individual experiences, but a common manifested circumstance."
  },
  {
   "id": "b523",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, here’s something particularly important.",
   "directed": "Now, here’s something particularly important."
  },
  {
   "id": "b524",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The same limiting powers can function differently depending upon their orientation.",
   "directed": "The same limiting powers can function differently depending upon their orientation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b525",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "If they operate in a way that supports recognition of Parameśvara, they are described as pure.",
   "directed": "If they operate in a way that supports recognition of Parameśvara, they are described as pure."
  },
  {
   "id": "b526",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "If they reinforce the contracted experience of saṃsāra, they are impure.",
   "directed": "If they reinforce the contracted experience of saṃsāra, they are impure."
  },
  {
   "id": "b527",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And what brings about the transformative orientation?",
   "directed": "And what brings about the transformative orientation?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b528",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Śaktipāta.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Śaktipāta."
  },
  {
   "id": "b529",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The descent of divine power.",
   "directed": "The descent of divine power."
  },
  {
   "id": "b530",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’ll discuss that properly later.",
   "directed": "We’ll discuss that properly later."
  },
  {
   "id": "b531",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "For now, understand that the issue isn’t simply whether you possess particular faculties.",
   "directed": "For now, understand that the issue isn’t simply whether you possess particular faculties."
  },
  {
   "id": "b532",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "It’s whether those faculties reinforce separateness or serve recognition.",
   "directed": "It’s whether those faculties reinforce separateness or serve recognition."
  },
  {
   "id": "b533",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And now, at last, we can descend through the specific limiting principles.",
   "directed": "And now, at last, we can descend through the specific limiting principles."
  },
  {
   "id": "b534",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "This is where Śiva gets his little individual identity.",
   "directed": "This is where Śiva gets his little individual identity."
  },
  {
   "id": "b535",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "11. Kalā — from unlimited agency to “I can do a few things”\nFirst:",
   "directed": "[short pause] 11. Kalā — from unlimited agency to “I can do a few things”\nFirst:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b536",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Kalā-tattva.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Kalā-tattva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b537",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The principle of limited agency.",
   "directed": "The principle of limited agency."
  },
  {
   "id": "b538",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now remember the absolute power of Śiva.",
   "directed": "Now remember the absolute power of Śiva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b539",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Kriyā-śakti.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Kriyā-śakti."
  },
  {
   "id": "b540",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Unrestricted creative action.",
   "directed": "Unrestricted creative action."
  },
  {
   "id": "b541",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "No limitation.",
   "directed": "No limitation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b542",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Nothing outside its capacity.",
   "directed": "Nothing outside its capacity."
  },
  {
   "id": "b543",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But when consciousness assumes the contracted condition of individuality, its agency appears restricted.",
   "directed": "But when consciousness assumes the contracted condition of individuality, its agency appears restricted."
  },
  {
   "id": "b544",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And kalā provides the limited individual with:",
   "directed": "[short pause] And kalā provides the limited individual with:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b545",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Kiṃcit-kartṛtva.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Kiṃcit-kartṛtva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b546",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The capacity to do something.",
   "directed": "The capacity to do something."
  },
  {
   "id": "b547",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Let’s break that down.",
   "directed": "Let’s break that down."
  },
  {
   "id": "b548",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Kiṃcit — something, a little, a particular amount.",
   "directed": "Kiṃcit — something, a little, a particular amount."
  },
  {
   "id": "b549",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Kartṛtva — agency, the condition of being an agent.",
   "directed": "Kartṛtva — agency, the condition of being an agent."
  },
  {
   "id": "b550",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So:",
   "directed": "[short pause] So:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b551",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A little bit of agency.",
   "directed": "A little bit of agency."
  },
  {
   "id": "b552",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Quite a downgrade.",
   "directed": "Quite a downgrade."
  },
  {
   "id": "b553",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Imagine going from:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Imagine going from:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b554",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I freely manifest the entire universe.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I freely manifest the entire universe.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b555",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I reckon I can make a sandwich.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I reckon I can make a sandwich.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b556",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And even that’s assuming you’ve got bread.",
   "directed": "And even that’s assuming you’ve got bread."
  },
  {
   "id": "b557",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, how does kalā arise?",
   "directed": "Now, how does kalā arise?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b558",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Through the conjunction of Māyā and the contracted individual.",
   "directed": "Through the conjunction of Māyā and the contracted individual."
  },
  {
   "id": "b559",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And Abhinavagupta makes a crucial distinction.",
   "directed": "And Abhinavagupta makes a crucial distinction."
  },
  {
   "id": "b560",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The individual consciousness isn’t intrinsically altered.",
   "directed": "The individual consciousness isn’t intrinsically altered."
  },
  {
   "id": "b561",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Rather, Māyā undergoes the modification through which limited agency appears.",
   "directed": "Rather, Māyā undergoes the modification through which limited agency appears."
  },
  {
   "id": "b562",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The conscious principle remains, in its essence, immutable.",
   "directed": "The conscious principle remains, in its essence, immutable."
  },
  {
   "id": "b563",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But its condition of manifestation is now different.",
   "directed": "But its condition of manifestation is now different."
  },
  {
   "id": "b564",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The result is such intimate conjunction between the individual and kalā that their distinction becomes exceedingly difficult to perceive.",
   "directed": "The result is such intimate conjunction between the individual and kalā that their distinction becomes exceedingly difficult to perceive."
  },
  {
   "id": "b565",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You don’t ordinarily think:",
   "directed": "[short pause] You don’t ordinarily think:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b566",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“Ah, here is pure awareness, and here is the limiting principle through which agency appears.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “Ah, here is pure awareness, and here is the limiting principle through which agency appears.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b567",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You simply say:",
   "directed": "[short pause] You simply say:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b568",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I am doing this.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I am doing this.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b569",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And take that limited agency to be the entirety of yourself.",
   "directed": "And take that limited agency to be the entirety of yourself."
  },
  {
   "id": "b570",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now this brings us to a remarkable discussion of liberation.",
   "directed": "Now this brings us to a remarkable discussion of liberation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b571",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "12. There are different depths of liberation\nAbhinavagupta explains that, through the grace of a divine lord and the exhaustion of karma, different discriminations can arise.",
   "directed": "12. There are different depths of liberation\nAbhinavagupta explains that, through the grace of a divine lord and the exhaustion of karma, different discriminations can arise."
  },
  {
   "id": "b572",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Viveka.",
   "directed": "Viveka."
  },
  {
   "id": "b573",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Discernment.",
   "directed": "Discernment."
  },
  {
   "id": "b574",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "First, you may distinguish the individual consciousness from Māyā.",
   "directed": "First, you may distinguish the individual consciousness from Māyā."
  },
  {
   "id": "b575",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Māyā-puruṣa-viveka.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Māyā-puruṣa-viveka."
  },
  {
   "id": "b576",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "This permits the condition of the Vijñānākala, above Māyā.",
   "directed": "This permits the condition of the Vijñānākala, above Māyā."
  },
  {
   "id": "b577",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Or you may distinguish consciousness from kalā.",
   "directed": "Or you may distinguish consciousness from kalā."
  },
  {
   "id": "b578",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Kalā-puṃ-viveka.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Kalā-puṃ-viveka."
  },
  {
   "id": "b579",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And rest above that limiting principle.",
   "directed": "And rest above that limiting principle."
  },
  {
   "id": "b580",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Or distinguish puruṣa from prakṛti.",
   "directed": "Or distinguish puruṣa from prakṛti."
  },
  {
   "id": "b581",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Prakṛti-puruṣa-viveka.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Prakṛti-puruṣa-viveka."
  },
  {
   "id": "b582",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And no longer wander within the domain governed by primordial nature.",
   "directed": "And no longer wander within the domain governed by primordial nature."
  },
  {
   "id": "b583",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now here’s the really important distinction.",
   "directed": "Now here’s the really important distinction."
  },
  {
   "id": "b584",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Even these liberations are understood according to the particular limitation that has been overcome.",
   "directed": "Even these liberations are understood according to the particular limitation that has been overcome."
  },
  {
   "id": "b585",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "If mala itself is distinguished from puruṣa, there’s an attainment comparable to Śiva.",
   "directed": "If mala itself is distinguished from puruṣa, there’s an attainment comparable to Śiva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b586",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Śiva-samānatva.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Śiva-samānatva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b587",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But when the fullness of puruṣa is directly recognised?",
   "directed": "But when the fullness of puruṣa is directly recognised?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b588",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Puruṣa-pūrṇatā-dṛṣṭi.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Puruṣa-pūrṇatā-dṛṣṭi."
  },
  {
   "id": "b589",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Then:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b590",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Śivatvam eva.",
   "directed": "Śivatvam eva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b591",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Śiva-hood itself.",
   "directed": "Śiva-hood itself."
  },
  {
   "id": "b592",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Not merely escape from one particular realm.",
   "directed": "Not merely escape from one particular realm."
  },
  {
   "id": "b593",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Not merely freedom from some limited condition.",
   "directed": "Not merely freedom from some limited condition."
  },
  {
   "id": "b594",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The recognition of fullness.",
   "directed": "The recognition of fullness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b595",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And notice the recurring principle.",
   "directed": "And notice the recurring principle."
  },
  {
   "id": "b596",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Liberation isn’t about running higher and higher up the cosmic ladder indefinitely.",
   "directed": "Liberation isn’t about running higher and higher up the cosmic ladder indefinitely."
  },
  {
   "id": "b597",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "It’s about recognition of the supreme nature of consciousness.",
   "directed": "It’s about recognition of the supreme nature of consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b598",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Right.",
   "directed": "[short pause] Right."
  },
  {
   "id": "b599",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Back to our poor little individual.",
   "directed": "Back to our poor little individual."
  },
  {
   "id": "b600",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’ve given him limited agency.",
   "directed": "We’ve given him limited agency."
  },
  {
   "id": "b601",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But there’s a problem.",
   "directed": "But there’s a problem."
  },
  {
   "id": "b602",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You can’t do anything intelligently if you don’t know anything.",
   "directed": "You can’t do anything intelligently if you don’t know anything."
  },
  {
   "id": "b603",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So we’re going to need another tattva.",
   "directed": "So we’re going to need another tattva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b604",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "13. Aśuddhavidyā — congratulations, you now know three things\nNow comes:",
   "directed": "[short pause] 13. Aśuddhavidyā — congratulations, you now know three things\nNow comes:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b605",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Aśuddhavidyā.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Aśuddhavidyā."
  },
  {
   "id": "b606",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Impure or limited knowledge.",
   "directed": "Impure or limited knowledge."
  },
  {
   "id": "b607",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And the important function is:",
   "directed": "[short pause] And the important function is:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b608",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Kiṃcit-jñatva.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Kiṃcit-jñatva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b609",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Knowing something.",
   "directed": "Knowing something."
  },
  {
   "id": "b610",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Not everything.",
   "directed": "Not everything."
  },
  {
   "id": "b611",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Just a bit.",
   "directed": "Just a bit."
  },
  {
   "id": "b612",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So we’ve got:",
   "directed": "[short pause] So we’ve got:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b613",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Kalā — I can do something.",
   "directed": "Kalā — I can do something."
  },
  {
   "id": "b614",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Vidyā — I know something.",
   "directed": "Vidyā — I know something."
  },
  {
   "id": "b615",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And here is where the trouble begins.",
   "directed": "And here is where the trouble begins."
  },
  {
   "id": "b616",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because unlimited consciousness doesn’t know things by standing apart from them as an ignorant subject trying to acquire information.",
   "directed": "Because unlimited consciousness doesn’t know things by standing apart from them as an ignorant subject trying to acquire information."
  },
  {
   "id": "b617",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But the contracted individual does.",
   "directed": "But the contracted individual does."
  },
  {
   "id": "b618",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now the individual says:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Now the individual says:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b619",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I know what that is.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I know what that is.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b620",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I don’t know what that is.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I don’t know what that is.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b621",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I understand this.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I understand this.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b622",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I’ve never heard of that.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I’ve never heard of that.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b623",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And the power of limited knowledge makes these restricted cognitions possible.",
   "directed": "And the power of limited knowledge makes these restricted cognitions possible."
  },
  {
   "id": "b624",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, Abhinavagupta introduces something interesting.",
   "directed": "Now, Abhinavagupta introduces something interesting."
  },
  {
   "id": "b625",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Buddhi.",
   "directed": "Buddhi."
  },
  {
   "id": "b626",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The intellect.",
   "directed": "The intellect."
  },
  {
   "id": "b627",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "He says limited vidyā apprehends and distinguishes the appearances reflected within buddhi.",
   "directed": "He says limited vidyā apprehends and distinguishes the appearances reflected within buddhi."
  },
  {
   "id": "b628",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Including experiences such as pleasure.",
   "directed": "Including experiences such as pleasure."
  },
  {
   "id": "b629",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Sukha.",
   "directed": "Sukha."
  },
  {
   "id": "b630",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And other forms of experience.",
   "directed": "And other forms of experience."
  },
  {
   "id": "b631",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But buddhi itself has a mixed character.",
   "directed": "But buddhi itself has a mixed character."
  },
  {
   "id": "b632",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "It contains different qualities.",
   "directed": "It contains different qualities."
  },
  {
   "id": "b633",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And it cannot, by itself, perform the required discrimination in the way vidyā does.",
   "directed": "And it cannot, by itself, perform the required discrimination in the way vidyā does."
  },
  {
   "id": "b634",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So here’s the distinction.",
   "directed": "So here’s the distinction."
  },
  {
   "id": "b635",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Buddhi provides the field in which the object is reflected.",
   "directed": "Buddhi provides the field in which the object is reflected."
  },
  {
   "id": "b636",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Vidyā makes a limited discrimination of what’s reflected there.",
   "directed": "Vidyā makes a limited discrimination of what’s reflected there."
  },
  {
   "id": "b637",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Imagine looking at a cluttered desk.",
   "directed": "Imagine looking at a cluttered desk."
  },
  {
   "id": "b638",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Books.",
   "directed": "Books."
  },
  {
   "id": "b639",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Papers.",
   "directed": "Papers."
  },
  {
   "id": "b640",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Cups.",
   "directed": "Cups."
  },
  {
   "id": "b641",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A half-eaten biscuit.",
   "directed": "A half-eaten biscuit."
  },
  {
   "id": "b642",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "An enormous collection of nonsense.",
   "directed": "An enormous collection of nonsense."
  },
  {
   "id": "b643",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Buddhi presents the material of cognition.",
   "directed": "Buddhi presents the material of cognition."
  },
  {
   "id": "b644",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Vidyā enables particular determinations.",
   "directed": "Vidyā enables particular determinations."
  },
  {
   "id": "b645",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“That’s my book.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “That’s my book.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b646",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“That’s tea.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “That’s tea.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b647",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“That’s a biscuit.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “That’s a biscuit.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b648",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“That biscuit’s been there for three days.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “That biscuit’s been there for three days.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b649",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, the point isn’t that these are physically separate machines inside your skull.",
   "directed": "Now, the point isn’t that these are physically separate machines inside your skull."
  },
  {
   "id": "b650",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "They’re analytically distinct principles of cognition.",
   "directed": "They’re analytically distinct principles of cognition."
  },
  {
   "id": "b651",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And notice the limitation.",
   "directed": "And notice the limitation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b652",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
