   "directed": "[slowly] Kiṃcit."
  },
  {
   "id": "b807",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The particularity, or limitedness, of that agency.",
   "directed": "The particularity, or limitedness, of that agency."
  },
  {
   "id": "b808",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now we’ve dealt with the agency side through kalā and the associated limiting principles.",
   "directed": "Now we’ve dealt with the agency side through kalā and the associated limiting principles."
  },
  {
   "id": "b809",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But the restricted subject needs an objective field.",
   "directed": "But the restricted subject needs an objective field."
  },
  {
   "id": "b810",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Something knowable.",
   "directed": "Something knowable."
  },
  {
   "id": "b811",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Something experienceable.",
   "directed": "Something experienceable."
  },
  {
   "id": "b812",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And that’s where:",
   "directed": "[short pause] And that’s where:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b813",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Prakṛti-tattva",
   "directed": "[slowly] Prakṛti-tattva"
  },
  {
   "id": "b814",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "enters the picture.",
   "directed": "enters the picture."
  },
  {
   "id": "b815",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Primordial nature.",
   "directed": "Primordial nature."
  },
  {
   "id": "b816",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now Prakṛti isn’t yet a fully differentiated collection of chairs, trees, mountains and inconvenient people.",
   "directed": "Now Prakṛti isn’t yet a fully differentiated collection of chairs, trees, mountains and inconvenient people."
  },
  {
   "id": "b817",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "It’s the general condition underlying experienceable objects.",
   "directed": "It’s the general condition underlying experienceable objects."
  },
  {
   "id": "b818",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The potential for differentiated enjoyment and suffering.",
   "directed": "The potential for differentiated enjoyment and suffering."
  },
  {
   "id": "b819",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And its nature is described through three fundamental experiential qualities.",
   "directed": "And its nature is described through three fundamental experiential qualities."
  },
  {
   "id": "b820",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Pleasure.",
   "directed": "Pleasure."
  },
  {
   "id": "b821",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Sukha.",
   "directed": "Sukha."
  },
  {
   "id": "b822",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Pain.",
   "directed": "Pain."
  },
  {
   "id": "b823",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Duḥkha.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Duḥkha."
  },
  {
   "id": "b824",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And confusion or delusion.",
   "directed": "And confusion or delusion."
  },
  {
   "id": "b825",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Moha.",
   "directed": "Moha."
  },
  {
   "id": "b826",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now Abhinavagupta makes an important point.",
   "directed": "Now Abhinavagupta makes an important point."
  },
  {
   "id": "b827",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The limited subject and its experienceable field arise together through the manifestation associated with kalā.",
   "directed": "The limited subject and its experienceable field arise together through the manifestation associated with kalā."
  },
  {
   "id": "b828",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Bhoktṛ-bhogya.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Bhoktṛ-bhogya."
  },
  {
   "id": "b829",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Enjoyer and enjoyed.",
   "directed": "Enjoyer and enjoyed."
  },
  {
   "id": "b830",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Subject and object.",
   "directed": "Subject and object."
  },
  {
   "id": "b831",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because what would an enjoyer be without anything to enjoy?",
   "directed": "Because what would an enjoyer be without anything to enjoy?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b832",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And what would it mean for something to be enjoyed without an enjoyer?",
   "directed": "And what would it mean for something to be enjoyed without an enjoyer?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b833",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "They belong together within the structure of differentiated experience.",
   "directed": "They belong together within the structure of differentiated experience."
  },
  {
   "id": "b834",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, don’t imagine that consciousness has actually had to wait for one to be manufactured before making the other.",
   "directed": "Now, don’t imagine that consciousness has actually had to wait for one to be manufactured before making the other."
  },
  {
   "id": "b835",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’ve already established that creation is ultimately nonsequential.",
   "directed": "We’ve already established that creation is ultimately nonsequential."
  },
  {
   "id": "b836",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But it may be described sequentially for the sake of understanding.",
   "directed": "But it may be described sequentially for the sake of understanding."
  },
  {
   "id": "b837",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And here’s a particularly nice observation.",
   "directed": "And here’s a particularly nice observation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b838",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The order of limited knowledge and attachment can vary.",
   "directed": "The order of limited knowledge and attachment can vary."
  },
  {
   "id": "b839",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Sometimes you become attracted to something and then investigate it.",
   "directed": "Sometimes you become attracted to something and then investigate it."
  },
  {
   "id": "b840",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Sometimes you learn about something and only afterward develop an attachment.",
   "directed": "Sometimes you learn about something and only afterward develop an attachment."
  },
  {
   "id": "b841",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Think about that.",
   "directed": "Think about that."
  },
  {
   "id": "b842",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You might see a beautiful object and immediately want it.",
