  {
   "id": "b843",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then discover what it actually is.",
   "directed": "Then discover what it actually is."
  },
  {
   "id": "b844",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Or you might study something for years and gradually develop an extraordinary love for it.",
   "directed": "Or you might study something for years and gradually develop an extraordinary love for it."
  },
  {
   "id": "b845",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Different apparent sequences.",
   "directed": "Different apparent sequences."
  },
  {
   "id": "b846",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Same underlying principles.",
   "directed": "Same underlying principles."
  },
  {
   "id": "b847",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So Abhinavagupta tells us not to treat different scriptural enumerations as contradictions merely because they give different orders.",
   "directed": "So Abhinavagupta tells us not to treat different scriptural enumerations as contradictions merely because they give different orders."
  },
  {
   "id": "b848",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The metaphysical structure doesn’t require one rigid chronology.",
   "directed": "The metaphysical structure doesn’t require one rigid chronology."
  },
  {
   "id": "b849",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Right.",
   "directed": "[short pause] Right."
  },
  {
   "id": "b850",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now let’s see what happens when Prakṛti becomes disturbed.",
   "directed": "Now let’s see what happens when Prakṛti becomes disturbed."
  },
  {
   "id": "b851",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "19. The three guṇas — bliss, misery and absolute confusion\nNow we encounter:",
   "directed": "[short pause] 19. The three guṇas — bliss, misery and absolute confusion\nNow we encounter:"
