   "directed": "[slowly] Pāyu."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1121",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The organ of excretion.",
   "directed": "The organ of excretion."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1122",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, rather unglamorous, but perfectly necessary.",
   "directed": "Now, rather unglamorous, but perfectly necessary."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1123",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Even the divine universe has apparently got to account for defecation.",
   "directed": "Even the divine universe has apparently got to account for defecation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1124",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "No getting around it.",
   "directed": "No getting around it."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1125",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Second: Taking something inward\nĀdāna.",
   "directed": "Second: Taking something inward\nĀdāna."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1126",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Grasping.",
   "directed": "Grasping."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1127",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Acquiring.",
   "directed": "Acquiring."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1128",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And this corresponds to:",
   "directed": "[short pause] And this corresponds to:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1129",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Pāṇi.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Pāṇi."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1130",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The hands.",
   "directed": "The hands."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1131",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Imagine picking up a cup.",
   "directed": "Imagine picking up a cup."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1132",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You intend to take something.",
   "directed": "You intend to take something."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1133",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The hand is the principal instrument through which that activity is expressed.",
   "directed": "The hand is the principal instrument through which that activity is expressed."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1134",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Third: Both giving and taking\nMovement involves a combination of these orientations.",
   "directed": "Third: Both giving and taking\nMovement involves a combination of these orientations."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1135",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And this corresponds to:",
   "directed": "[short pause] And this corresponds to:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1136",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Pāda.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Pāda."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1137",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The feet.",
   "directed": "The feet."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1138",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You move from one place to another, withdrawing from one position and approaching another.",
   "directed": "You move from one place to another, withdrawing from one position and approaching another."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1139",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Fourth: Repose beyond that opposition\nNow comes:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Fourth: Repose beyond that opposition\nNow comes:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1140",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Upastha.",
   "directed": "Upastha."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1141",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The generative or sexual faculty.",
   "directed": "The generative or sexual faculty."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1142",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And in this classification it is associated with a form of repose beyond the simple opposition of taking and giving.",
   "directed": "And in this classification it is associated with a form of repose beyond the simple opposition of taking and giving."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1143",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Svarūpa-viśrānti.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Svarūpa-viśrānti."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1144",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Resting in one’s own nature.",
   "directed": "Resting in one’s own nature."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1145",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, don’t assume this means every sexual act is automatically a mystical realisation.",
   "directed": "Now, don’t assume this means every sexual act is automatically a mystical realisation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1146",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’re dealing with Abhinavagupta’s functional classification of the faculty.",
   "directed": "We’re dealing with Abhinavagupta’s functional classification of the faculty."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1147",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But notice the conceptual elegance.",
   "directed": "But notice the conceptual elegance."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1148",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Release.",
   "directed": "Release."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1149",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Acquisition.",
   "directed": "Acquisition."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1150",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Their combination.",
   "directed": "Their combination."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1151",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And repose beyond the pair.",
   "directed": "And repose beyond the pair."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1152",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Four outward orientations.",
   "directed": "Four outward orientations."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1153",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now there’s one more.",
   "directed": "Now there’s one more."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1154",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Fifth: The inward activity of speech\nVāk.",
   "directed": "Fifth: The inward activity of speech\nVāk."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1155",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Speech.",
   "directed": "Speech."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1156",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And this is related to the internal activity associated with vital energy.",
   "directed": "And this is related to the internal activity associated with vital energy."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1157",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Prāṇa.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Prāṇa."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1158",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, speech isn’t merely moving your mouth.",
   "directed": "Now, speech isn’t merely moving your mouth."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1159",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "It’s the articulation of an intention through a particular faculty.",
   "directed": "It’s the articulation of an intention through a particular faculty."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1160",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And that faculty belongs to the agency of the individual.",
   "directed": "And that faculty belongs to the agency of the individual."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1161",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So we’ve got five powers of action.",
   "directed": "So we’ve got five powers of action."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1162",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Release.",
   "directed": "Release."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1163",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Grasping.",
   "directed": "Grasping."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1164",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Movement.",
   "directed": "Movement."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1165",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Generation or repose.",
   "directed": "Generation or repose."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1166",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Speech.",
   "directed": "Speech."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1167",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, suppose someone objects:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Now, suppose someone objects:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1168",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "man",
   "text": "“But Abhinava, I can move my hand as well as grab things with it. Shouldn’t movement be an additional hand-faculty?”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “But Abhinava, I can move my hand as well as grab things with it. Shouldn’t movement be an additional hand-faculty?”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1169",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "No.",
   "directed": "No."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1170",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because the movement of the hand still belongs functionally to the power of movement.",
   "directed": "Because the movement of the hand still belongs functionally to the power of movement."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1171",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The physical location of a faculty doesn’t exhaust the classification of the action.",
   "directed": "The physical location of a faculty doesn’t exhaust the classification of the action."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1172",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The hand might be the principal seat of grasping, but movements occurring there can belong to the more general capacity for motion.",
   "directed": "The hand might be the principal seat of grasping, but movements occurring there can belong to the more general capacity for motion."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1173",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And because the fundamental orientations of action are five, the innumerable particular actions don’t require innumerable independent faculties.",
   "directed": "And because the fundamental orientations of action are five, the innumerable particular actions don’t require innumerable independent faculties."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1174",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now here’s something interesting.",
   "directed": "Now here’s something interesting."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1175",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Abhinavagupta acknowledges that other authorities classify their origins differently.",
   "directed": "Abhinavagupta acknowledges that other authorities classify their origins differently."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1176",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Some associate the mind with rajas.",
   "directed": "Some associate the mind with rajas."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1177",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Others place the mind in sattva and the sense faculties in rajas.",
   "directed": "Others place the mind in sattva and the sense faculties in rajas."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1178",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And some assign rajas a connecting function.",
   "directed": "And some assign rajas a connecting function."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1179",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So the details of the classificatory account vary.",
   "directed": "So the details of the classificatory account vary."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1180",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But his principal argument remains:",
   "directed": "[short pause] But his principal argument remains:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1181",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "These faculties are expressions of the limited individual’s powers of cognition and action, differentiated through ahaṃkāra.",
   "directed": "These faculties are expressions of the limited individual’s powers of cognition and action, differentiated through ahaṃkāra."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1182",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And now we’ve established the subject’s instruments.",
   "directed": "And now we’ve established the subject’s instruments."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1183",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The mind.",
   "directed": "The mind."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1184",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The senses.",
   "directed": "The senses."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1185",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The action faculties.",
   "directed": "The action faculties."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1186",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But we’re still missing something.",
   "directed": "But we’re still missing something."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1187",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The actual objects.",
   "directed": "The actual objects."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1188",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "What are you going to hear?",
   "directed": "What are you going to hear?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1189",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "See?",
   "directed": "See?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1190",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Smell?",
   "directed": "Smell?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1191",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Taste?",
   "directed": "Taste?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1192",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Touch?",
   "directed": "Touch?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1193",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "That’s where the final great stage of manifestation begins.",
   "directed": "That’s where the final great stage of manifestation begins."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1194",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "24. Tamas produces the subtle objects of experience\nNow we return to the tamasic aspect of ahaṃkāra.",
   "directed": "24. Tamas produces the subtle objects of experience\nNow we return to the tamasic aspect of ahaṃkāra."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1195",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The aspect associated with concealment.",
   "directed": "The aspect associated with concealment."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1196",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And from this arise:",
   "directed": "[short pause] And from this arise:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1197",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The five tanmātras.",
   "directed": "The five tanmātras."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1198",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, this is a beautiful Sanskrit word.",
   "directed": "Now, this is a beautiful Sanskrit word."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1199",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Tan-mātra.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Tan-mātra."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1200",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Literally, something like “that alone” or “merely that.”",
   "directed": "Literally, something like “that alone” or “merely that.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1201",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And in this philosophical system it refers to the subtle potential underlying a particular sensory quality.",
   "directed": "And in this philosophical system it refers to the subtle potential underlying a particular sensory quality."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1202",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Not yet a gross physical object.",
   "directed": "Not yet a gross physical object."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1203",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "For example:",
   "directed": "[short pause] For example:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1204",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Śabda-tanmātra.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Śabda-tanmātra."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1205",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The subtle principle of sound.",
   "directed": "The subtle principle of sound."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1206",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now imagine every particular sound.",
   "directed": "Now imagine every particular sound."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1207",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A bird singing.",
   "directed": "A bird singing."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1208",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Someone speaking.",
   "directed": "Someone speaking."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1209",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A bell ringing.",
   "directed": "A bell ringing."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1210",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Rain falling.",
   "directed": "Rain falling."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1211",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A gecko making some absolutely ridiculous noise behind your wall.",
   "directed": "A gecko making some absolutely ridiculous noise behind your wall."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1212",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "They’re all different.",
   "directed": "They’re all different."
  },
