   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Sound + touch + form",
   "directed": "Sound + touch + form"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1314",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "4",
   "directed": "4"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1315",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Āpas — Water",
   "directed": "Āpas — Water"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1316",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Sound + touch + form + taste",
   "directed": "Sound + touch + form + taste"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1317",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "5",
   "directed": "5"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1318",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Pṛthivī — Earth",
   "directed": "Pṛthivī — Earth"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1319",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Sound + touch + form + taste + smell",
   "directed": "Sound + touch + form + taste + smell"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1320",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, isn’t that fascinating?",
   "directed": "Now, isn’t that fascinating?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1321",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The physical world is being analysed as an increasingly differentiated collection of sensible qualities.",
   "directed": "The physical world is being analysed as an increasingly differentiated collection of sensible qualities."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1322",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Space provides the domain of sound.",
   "directed": "Space provides the domain of sound."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1323",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Air includes touch.",
   "directed": "Air includes touch."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1324",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Fire includes visible form.",
   "directed": "Fire includes visible form."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1325",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Water includes taste.",
   "directed": "Water includes taste."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1326",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Earth includes smell.",
   "directed": "Earth includes smell."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1327",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And every later element retains the earlier associated qualities.",
   "directed": "And every later element retains the earlier associated qualities."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1328",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, Abhinavagupta mentions that some other authorities explain the process somewhat differently.",
   "directed": "Now, Abhinavagupta mentions that some other authorities explain the process somewhat differently."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1329",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "They describe air arising through the combination of sound and touch, and proceed through increasingly comprehensive combinations until earth arises from all five.",
   "directed": "They describe air arising through the combination of sound and touch, and proceed through increasingly comprehensive combinations until earth arises from all five."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1330",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Another variant of the causal arrangement.",
   "directed": "Another variant of the causal arrangement."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1331",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Remember what we established at the beginning?",
   "directed": "Remember what we established at the beginning?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1332",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The conventional relationships of cause and effect can be described in different ways.",
   "directed": "The conventional relationships of cause and effect can be described in different ways."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1333",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And those differences needn’t undermine the ultimate causal foundation.",
   "directed": "And those differences needn’t undermine the ultimate causal foundation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1334",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But then he says something absolutely wonderful.",
   "directed": "But then he says something absolutely wonderful."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1335",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Something that brings us right back to the nature of substances and their properties.",
   "directed": "Something that brings us right back to the nature of substances and their properties."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1336",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "26. Earth isn’t some mysterious thing hiding behind its qualities\nRight.",
   "directed": "26. Earth isn’t some mysterious thing hiding behind its qualities\nRight."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1337",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Imagine you’ve got a lump of earth.",
   "directed": "Imagine you’ve got a lump of earth."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1338",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A stone, perhaps.",
   "directed": "A stone, perhaps."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1339",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And you describe it.",
   "directed": "And you describe it."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1340",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "It’s hard.",
   "directed": "It’s hard."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1341",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "It’s heavy.",
   "directed": "It’s heavy."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1342",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "It has a particular colour.",
   "directed": "It has a particular colour."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1343",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A texture.",
   "directed": "A texture."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1344",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A smell.",
   "directed": "A smell."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1345",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You can interact with it through various senses.",
   "directed": "You can interact with it through various senses."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1346",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, you might think:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Now, you might think:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1347",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "man",
   "text": "“Well, those are all properties OF the stone.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “Well, those are all properties OF the stone.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1348",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And Abhinavagupta asks:",
   "directed": "[short pause] And Abhinavagupta asks:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1349",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "What’s this additional thing behind all the properties?",
   "directed": "What’s this additional thing behind all the properties?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1350",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Some completely separate substance that possesses them?",
   "directed": "Some completely separate substance that possesses them?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1351",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "He says:",
   "directed": "[short pause] He says:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1352",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Guṇa-samudāya-mātram.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Guṇa-samudāya-mātram."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1353",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Merely a collection of qualities.",
   "directed": "Merely a collection of qualities."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1354",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And:",
   "directed": "[short pause] And:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1355",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Na anyaḥ guṇī kaścit.",
   "directed": "Na anyaḥ guṇī kaścit."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1356",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "There isn’t some other separate possessor of those qualities.",
   "directed": "There isn’t some other separate possessor of those qualities."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1357",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now that’s fascinating.",
   "directed": "Now that’s fascinating."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1358",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because he’s rejecting the necessity of an additional underlying object existing independently of the qualities through which the element is manifested.",
   "directed": "Because he’s rejecting the necessity of an additional underlying object existing independently of the qualities through which the element is manifested."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1359",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The particular element is constituted by its relevant collection of qualities.",
   "directed": "The particular element is constituted by its relevant collection of qualities."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1360",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You don’t need to invent a mysterious second entity standing behind them.",
   "directed": "You don’t need to invent a mysterious second entity standing behind them."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1361",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And now we arrive at one of the most important principles in the entire cosmology.",
   "directed": "And now we arrive at one of the most important principles in the entire cosmology."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1362",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Remember Chapter Seven?",
   "directed": "Remember Chapter Seven?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1363",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The higher pervades the lower.",
   "directed": "The higher pervades the lower."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1364",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Well, he’s bringing that back.",
   "directed": "Well, he’s bringing that back."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1365",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "27. The higher qualities pervade the lower\nNow, within this collection of tattvas, Abhinavagupta states that the higher principle possesses a more comprehensive character.",
   "directed": "27. The higher qualities pervade the lower\nNow, within this collection of tattvas, Abhinavagupta states that the higher principle possesses a more comprehensive character."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1366",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Vyāpaka.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Vyāpaka."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1367",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Pervading.",
   "directed": "Pervading."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1368",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The lower principle is:",
   "directed": "[short pause] The lower principle is:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1369",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Vyāpya.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Vyāpya."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1370",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Pervaded.",
   "directed": "Pervaded."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1371",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And here’s how he explains the superiority of one principle over another.",
   "directed": "And here’s how he explains the superiority of one principle over another."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1372",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "A higher principle is more fundamental when the lower cannot be established without it.",
   "directed": "A higher principle is more fundamental when the lower cannot be established without it."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1373",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Let me put that into ordinary language.",
   "directed": "Let me put that into ordinary language."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1374",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Suppose a particular manifested thing depends upon a more fundamental condition.",
   "directed": "Suppose a particular manifested thing depends upon a more fundamental condition."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1375",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The more fundamental condition pervades or grounds it.",
   "directed": "The more fundamental condition pervades or grounds it."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1376",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So earth is pervaded by water.",
   "directed": "So earth is pervaded by water."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1377",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Water by fire.",
   "directed": "Water by fire."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1378",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Fire by air.",
   "directed": "Fire by air."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1379",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Air by space.",
   "directed": "Air by space."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1380",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And the sequence continues upward through the subtler principles.",
   "directed": "And the sequence continues upward through the subtler principles."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1381",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "All the way toward Śakti.",
   "directed": "All the way toward Śakti."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1382",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And the supreme reality of consciousness grounds the entire process.",
   "directed": "And the supreme reality of consciousness grounds the entire process."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1383",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, notice something extraordinary.",
   "directed": "Now, notice something extraordinary."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1384",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’ve arrived at exactly the principle we established at the beginning of the chapter.",
   "directed": "We’ve arrived at exactly the principle we established at the beginning of the chapter."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1385",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The individual tattvas are not independently self-sufficient substances.",
   "directed": "The individual tattvas are not independently self-sufficient substances."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1386",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "They’re particular modes of manifestation.",
   "directed": "They’re particular modes of manifestation."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1387",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And their ultimate ground is the great universal luminosity.",
   "directed": "And their ultimate ground is the great universal luminosity."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1388",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Mahāprakāśa.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Mahāprakāśa."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1389",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Paramaśiva.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Paramaśiva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1390",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now think about the whole descent.",
   "directed": "Now think about the whole descent."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1391",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We began with unrestricted consciousness.",
   "directed": "We began with unrestricted consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1392",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then the predominance of its five powers.",
   "directed": "Then the predominance of its five powers."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1393",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then the pure tattvas.",
   "directed": "Then the pure tattvas."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1394",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then the limited individual and its fundamental impurity.",
   "directed": "Then the limited individual and its fundamental impurity."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1395",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then Māyā.",
   "directed": "Then Māyā."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1396",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then limited agency.",
   "directed": "Then limited agency."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1397",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Limited knowledge.",
   "directed": "Limited knowledge."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1398",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "meta",
   "voice": "none",
   "text": "Attachment.",
   "directed": "Attachment."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1399",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Time.",
   "directed": "[short pause] Time."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1400",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Determination.",
   "directed": "Determination."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1401",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then the individual experiencer.",
   "directed": "Then the individual experiencer."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1402",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Prakṛti.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Prakṛti."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1403",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The guṇas.",
   "directed": "The guṇas."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1404",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Intellect.",
   "directed": "Intellect."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1405",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The I-maker.",
   "directed": "The I-maker."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1406",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The mind.",
   "directed": "The mind."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1407",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The senses.",
   "directed": "The senses."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1408",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The powers of action.",
   "directed": "The powers of action."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1409",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The subtle sensory qualities.",
   "directed": "The subtle sensory qualities."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1410",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And finally the gross elements of physical experience.",
   "directed": "And finally the gross elements of physical experience."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1411",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The entire structure of manifested reality.",
   "directed": "The entire structure of manifested reality."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1412",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And at no point did we need to introduce a second ultimate substance standing independently outside Śiva.",
   "directed": "And at no point did we need to introduce a second ultimate substance standing independently outside Śiva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1413",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The distinctions are real as manifestations within this system.",
   "directed": "The distinctions are real as manifestations within this system."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1414",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But their ultimate reality remains one.",
   "directed": "But their ultimate reality remains one."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1415",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now here’s the really extraordinary thing.",
   "directed": "Now here’s the really extraordinary thing."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1416",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "28. The whole bloody universe is a manifestation of the I\nLet’s return to that earlier distinction.",
   "directed": "28. The whole bloody universe is a manifestation of the I\nLet’s return to that earlier distinction."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1417",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because I think it’s the heart of the chapter.",
   "directed": "Because I think it’s the heart of the chapter."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1418",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "At the level of ahaṃkāra, the limited individual appropriates an object as Self.",
   "directed": "At the level of ahaṃkāra, the limited individual appropriates an object as Self."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1419",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You think:",
   "directed": "[short pause] You think:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1420",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I am this body.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I am this body.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1421",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I am this personality.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I am this personality.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1422",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I am this particular organism with these particular capacities.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I am this particular organism with these particular capacities.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1423",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And Abhinavagupta says that is a constructed I.",
   "directed": "And Abhinavagupta says that is a constructed I."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1424",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Ahaṃkāra.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Ahaṃkāra."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1425",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But there is a more fundamental I.",
   "directed": "But there is a more fundamental I."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1426",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The pure self-awareness of consciousness.",
   "directed": "The pure self-awareness of consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1427",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Aham-vimarśa.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Aham-vimarśa."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1428",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And that doesn’t depend upon the constructed identity.",
   "directed": "And that doesn’t depend upon the constructed identity."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1429",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now, this is extremely important.",
   "directed": "Now, this is extremely important."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1430",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because we’re not trying to eliminate consciousness’s capacity for self-awareness.",
   "directed": "Because we’re not trying to eliminate consciousness’s capacity for self-awareness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1431",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "We’re trying to recognise that its true nature is not confined to the limited identity.",
   "directed": "We’re trying to recognise that its true nature is not confined to the limited identity."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1432",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "So think about everything we’ve just investigated.",
   "directed": "So think about everything we’ve just investigated."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1433",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The body.",
   "directed": "The body."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1434",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The senses.",
   "directed": "The senses."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1435",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The mind.",
   "directed": "The mind."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1436",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The objects.",
   "directed": "The objects."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1437",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The whole universe.",
   "directed": "The whole universe."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1438",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "All these are expressions of consciousness.",
   "directed": "All these are expressions of consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1439",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But the limited individual has taken one particular configuration of them and declared:",
   "directed": "[short pause] But the limited individual has taken one particular configuration of them and declared:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1440",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“That’s me.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “That’s me.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1441",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And everything else:",
   "directed": "[short pause] And everything else:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1442",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“Not me.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “Not me.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1443",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Now there’s your bondage.",
   "directed": "Now there’s your bondage."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1444",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The division.",
   "directed": "The division."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1445",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The contraction.",
   "directed": "The contraction."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1446",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Saṃkoca.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Saṃkoca."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1447",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But suppose you recognise the underlying reality.",
   "directed": "But suppose you recognise the underlying reality."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1448",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Suppose you recognise that the same luminosity through which your body appears also manifests the entire world.",
   "directed": "Suppose you recognise that the same luminosity through which your body appears also manifests the entire world."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1449",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Then the distinction between your restricted identity and what appears outside it no longer defines the ultimate nature of your Self.",
   "directed": "Then the distinction between your restricted identity and what appears outside it no longer defines the ultimate nature of your Self."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1450",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And the pure I-consciousness is recognised as something fundamentally different from the constructed ego.",
   "directed": "And the pure I-consciousness is recognised as something fundamentally different from the constructed ego."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1451",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Not simply a bigger personality.",
   "directed": "Not simply a bigger personality."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1452",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Not a gigantic cosmic version of yourself.",
   "directed": "Not a gigantic cosmic version of yourself."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1453",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But the self-awareness of consciousness itself.",
   "directed": "But the self-awareness of consciousness itself."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1454",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The absolute I isn’t the limited individual inflated to cosmic proportions.",
   "directed": "The absolute I isn’t the limited individual inflated to cosmic proportions."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1455",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "It’s the unrestricted self-apprehension of the reality in which every limited individual and every object appears.",
   "directed": "It’s the unrestricted self-apprehension of the reality in which every limited individual and every object appears."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1456",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And now you can appreciate why this chapter has gone into such painstaking detail.",
   "directed": "And now you can appreciate why this chapter has gone into such painstaking detail."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1457",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Why all the tattvas?",
   "directed": "Why all the tattvas?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1458",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Why the guṇas?",
   "directed": "Why the guṇas?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1459",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Why the senses?",
   "directed": "Why the senses?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1460",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Why the distinction between māyā as an inert tattva and Māyā as divine power?",
   "directed": "Why the distinction between māyā as an inert tattva and Māyā as divine power?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1461",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Why distinguish genuine I-consciousness from ahaṃkāra?",
   "directed": "Why distinguish genuine I-consciousness from ahaṃkāra?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1462",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Because you need to understand what you’re actually identifying yourself with.",
   "directed": "Because you need to understand what you’re actually identifying yourself with."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1463",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And which distinctions belong to the manifested world rather than the supreme nature of consciousness.",
   "directed": "And which distinctions belong to the manifested world rather than the supreme nature of consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1464",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You cannot simply say:",
   "directed": "[short pause] You cannot simply say:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1465",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“Everything is Śiva.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “Everything is Śiva.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1466",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And leave every underlying philosophical problem unresolved.",
   "directed": "And leave every underlying philosophical problem unresolved."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1467",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Abhinavagupta wants you to understand how everything is Śiva.",
   "directed": "Abhinavagupta wants you to understand how everything is Śiva."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1468",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "How the apparent many arise within the one.",
   "directed": "How the apparent many arise within the one."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1469",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "How conscious and insentient aspects are distinguished.",
   "directed": "How conscious and insentient aspects are distinguished."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1470",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "How agency becomes limited.",
   "directed": "How agency becomes limited."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1471",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "How knowledge becomes particular.",
   "directed": "How knowledge becomes particular."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1472",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "How attachment arises.",
   "directed": "How attachment arises."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1473",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "How the subject appropriates a body.",
   "directed": "How the subject appropriates a body."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1474",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And how the manifest universe, right down to its physical qualities, rests within a hierarchy ultimately grounded in supreme consciousness.",
   "directed": "And how the manifest universe, right down to its physical qualities, rests within a hierarchy ultimately grounded in supreme consciousness."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1475",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And that’s the remarkable thing.",
   "directed": "And that’s the remarkable thing."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1476",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You began with something apparently outside you.",
   "directed": "You began with something apparently outside you."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1477",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The physical world.",
   "directed": "The physical world."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1478",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And through the systematic investigation of its principles, you arrived at the consciousness through which it is manifest.",
   "directed": "And through the systematic investigation of its principles, you arrived at the consciousness through which it is manifest."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1479",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Not because you’ve escaped the world.",
   "directed": "Not because you’ve escaped the world."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1480",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "But because you’ve investigated its essential nature.",
   "directed": "But because you’ve investigated its essential nature."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1481",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "verse",
   "voice": "verse",
   "text": "Tattvasvarūpa.",
   "directed": "[slowly] Tattvasvarūpa."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1482",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And here’s a final thought.",
   "directed": "And here’s a final thought."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1483",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "You think:",
   "directed": "[short pause] You think:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1484",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "dialogue",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "“I’m this little human being sitting in the universe.”",
   "directed": "[short pause] “I’m this little human being sitting in the universe.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1485",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Abhinavagupta says:",
   "directed": "[short pause] Abhinavagupta says:"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1486",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "That very thought is the result of an extraordinary series of limiting manifestations.",
   "directed": "That very thought is the result of an extraordinary series of limiting manifestations."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1487",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The actual consciousness through which you think it?",
   "directed": "The actual consciousness through which you think it?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1488",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "That’s not confined to the little identity you’ve constructed.",
   "directed": "That’s not confined to the little identity you’ve constructed."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1489",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "And the whole hierarchy we’ve just described?",
   "directed": "And the whole hierarchy we’ve just described?"
  },
  {
   "id": "b1490",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "It is an expression of the freedom of that supreme reality.",
   "directed": "It is an expression of the freedom of that supreme reality."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1491",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "Śiva freely manifests the entire universe, including the limited individual who looks around and wonders where Śiva has gone.",
   "directed": "Śiva freely manifests the entire universe, including the limited individual who looks around and wonders where Śiva has gone."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1492",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "The absolute bloody cheek of it.",
   "directed": "The absolute bloody cheek of it."
  },
  {
   "id": "b1493",
   "section": "Tantrasāra — Chapter 8",
   "type": "narration",
   "voice": "granny",
   "text": "End of Chapter Eight — Tattvasvarūpaprakāśanam.",
   "directed": "End of Chapter Eight — Tattvasvarūpaprakāśanam."
  },
